van Cleef</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>van Ravenswaaij</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunner</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Smeets</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>van Kessel</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High-throughput analysis of subtelomeric chromosome rearrangements by use of array-based comparative genomic hybridization</article-title><source>Am J Hum Genet</source><year>2002</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>1269</fpage><lpage>1276</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11951177</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/340426</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vissers</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>De Vries</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Osoegawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Janssen</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name><name><surname>Feuth</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Choy</surname><given-names>CO</given-names></name><name><surname>Straatman</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Vliet</surname><given-names>W van der</given-names></name><name><surname>Huys</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name><name><surname>van Rijk</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Smeets</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>van Ravenswaaij-Arts</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Knoers</surname><given-names>NV</given-names></name><name><surname>Burgt</surname><given-names>I van der</given-names></name><name><surname>de Jong</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunner</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>van Kessel</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Schoenm